Hello, Overlords!

Overlewd will soon celebrate its first Anniversary, and the development team has prepared a lot of changes to further improve our players' gaming experience.

The Anniversary festivities will be held throughout the summer, and during this time, step by step, we'll deploy a few important updates. The pace we're aiming for is one update in a month during the Anniversary Festival. This process will be accompanied by a shower of gifts and rewards for our beloved players!

What to expect from us during the Festival:

 a lot of changes to the game;
 generous amount of gifts and rewards to celebrate our Anniversary;
 great mood;

More information on the first update coming June 10!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44209474/1f738d6bd3a86173c074298a0c397d9086275312.jpg

Tokyo Babefest event will begin on April 9!
The current event, Catgirl Frenzy, will be live until Overlord's departure to Tokyo, so use that time to spend your event resources and finish the quests.

Tokyo Babefest features:

 two hot guest matriarchs - Xissea & Yvy - with three hot scenes for you to unlock;
 two battle characters: Cyborg and the brand-new Maid;
 event's exclusive sex scenes;
 new quests and challenges;
 collectibles — this powerful items will make your Overlord even stronger;

You'll see a new event character (Maid) at the beginning of the event on enemy teams. You will be able to add Maid to your harem starting May 9.

